      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hermon_(hamlet)%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The first road through Hermon ran from Russell to De Kaib, opening just before the War of 1812.",
